#ASSERT `By when must I object to the costs estimate?` (`the day` 2 11 2026) EQUALS `the day` 23 11 2026
#ASSERT `How much security must I pay to object?` TRUE EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `How much security must I pay to object?` FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a full taxation?` (`the day` 2 11 2026) EQUALS `the day` 23 11 2026
